      "side": 1,
      "message": "Upload the it5271Ex spec on the bug.\nAbout the state machine, it\u0027s followed by UCSI spec, I also upload the pic on there.\n\nUCSI protocol flow:\n1.write [MSGOUT] \u0026 [CONTROL] in `[ST_WRITE]` state (may not have `[MSGOUT]`)\n2.INT assert, read [UCSI alert status] in `handle_irq()`\n3.read [CCI] in `[ST_GET_CCI]` state\n4.read [MSGIN] in  `[ST_READ]` state (may not have `[MSGIN]`)\n\n5.write [CONTROL: ACK_CC_CI cmd complete] in `[ST_WRITE_ACK]` state\n6.INT assert, read [UCSI alert status] in `handle_irq()`\n7.read [CCI] in `[ST_GET_CCI]` state\n\n\nAsynchronous interrupt (connector change indiacator) flow:\n1.INT assert, read [UCSI alert status] in `handle_irq()`\n2.read [CCI] in `[ST_GET_CCI]` state\n\n3.write [CONTROL: Get_Connector_Status] in `[ST_WRITE]` state\n4.INT assert, read [UCSI alert status] in `handle_irq()`\n5.read [CCI] in `[ST_GET_CCI]` state\n6.read [MSGIN] in  `[ST_READ]` state\n\n7.write [CONTROL: ACK_CC_CI cmd complete] in `[ST_WRITE_ACK]` state\n8.INT assert, read [UCSI alert status] in `handle_irq()`\n9.read [CCI] in `[ST_GET_CCI]` state",
